---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Cloud Identity | Blooming Systems Inc."
  description="Blooming Systems Inc. helps organizations design and modernize cloud identity environments, including authentication, SSO, MFA, access policies, and hybrid identity integration."
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">CLOUD IDENTITY</p>
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <h1>
            Move identity forward
            <span>without losing control.</span>
          </h1>
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <p>
              Cloud identity changes how organizations authenticate users,
              connect applications, enforce access policies, and operate
              security controls. We help build cloud identity environments
              that work across modern and hybrid estates.
            </p>
            <a href="/contact/" class="button">Discuss cloud identity <span>↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container split">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">MODERN IDENTITY</p>
          <h2>Cloud identity is becoming the control layer for access.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            Applications are increasingly delivered as cloud services, while
            organizations continue to operate hybrid infrastructure and
            legacy systems.
          </p>
          <p>
            A modern identity architecture needs to accommodate both worlds
            while providing consistent authentication and access controls.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dark-section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">CLOUD IDENTITY CAPABILITIES</p>
        <h2>Modern access built around <span>identity.</span></h2>

        <div class="grid">
          <article><strong>01</strong><h3>Single Sign-On</h3><p>Connect cloud and enterprise applications through centralized authentication.</p></article>
          <article><strong>02</strong><h3>Multi-Factor Authentication</h3><p>Implement stronger authentication controls across workforce and application environments.</p></article>
          <article><strong>03</strong><h3>Conditional Access</h3><p>Apply access policies based on identity, device, location, application, and other contextual signals.</p></article>
          <article><strong>04</strong><h3>Federation</h3><p>Establish identity relationships between platforms and organizations where required.</p></article>
          <article><strong>05</strong><h3>Application Integration</h3><p>Connect SaaS and enterprise applications to cloud identity services.</p></article>
          <article><strong>06</strong><h3>Hybrid Identity</h3><p>Integrate cloud identity capabilities with existing directory and infrastructure environments.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">MODERNIZATION PATH</p>
        <h2>From existing identity infrastructure to <span>cloud-enabled access.</span></h2>

        <div class="steps">
          <article><span>01</span><h3>Assess</h3><p>Understand current identity providers, directories, applications, authentication methods, and dependencies.</p></article>
          <article><span>02</span><h3>Architect</h3><p>Define the target cloud and hybrid identity model.</p></article>
          <article><span>03</span><h3>Integrate</h3><p>Connect applications, directories, and identity services.</p></article>
          <article><span>04</span><h3>Secure</h3><p>Establish authentication and contextual access policies.</p></article>
          <article><span>05</span><h3>Operate</h3><p>Monitor, maintain, and evolve the identity environment.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">READY FOR MODERN IDENTITY?</p>
        <h2>Build a cloud identity architecture that works <span>across your environment.</span></h2>
        <a href="/contact/" class="button">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page{color:var(--color-text)}.container{width:min(var(--container),calc(100% - (var(--gutter)*2)));margin:auto}.eyebrow{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:0 0 24px;color:var(--color-blue);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:28px;height:1px;background:var(--color-blue)}.hero{padding:180px 0 130px;background:#eef4ff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:100px;align-items:end}.hero h1{margin:0;color:var(--color-ink);font-size:clamp(52px,6vw,88px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.055em;font-weight:650}.hero h1 span,h2 span{display:block;color:var(--color-blue)}.hero-copy{max-width:520px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75}.button{display:inline-flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;min-height:52px;margin-top:28px;padding:0 24px;background:var(--color-blue);color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:var(--text-sm);font-weight:650}.section{padding:120px 0}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:100px}.split h2,h2{margin:0;color:var(--color-ink);font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,62px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:650}.prose{max-width:700px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8}.dark-section{padding:120px 0;background:var(--color-ink)}.dark-section h2{color:white;max-width:900px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;margin-top:65px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15)}.grid article{padding:38px;min-height:250px;background:var(--color-ink)}.grid strong,.steps span{color:var(--color-blue);font-size:40px}.grid h3{margin:40px 0 15px;color:white;font-size:22px}.grid p{margin:0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:60px}.steps article{padding:30px;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-border)}.steps h3{margin:42px 0 14px;color:var(--color-ink)}.steps p{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.cta{padding:120px 0;background:#eef4ff;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}.cta h2{max-width:950px}@media(max-width:1000px){.hero-grid,.split{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:45px}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:640px){.hero{padding:130px 0 90px}.section,.dark-section,.cta{padding:85px 0}.grid,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(46px,13vw,65px)}}
</style>